    "on": "regulation"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "It shields the islanders from mainland diseases they likely have no immunity to.",
   "cam": {
    "lat": 11.5548,
    "lon": 92.2408,
    "z": 13.5
   },
   "tag": {
